   "whichTutorial": 0,
   "tutorialStrings": [
    "Welcome to the Town Menu!\nFrom here, you can manage your party,\nequipment, and powers.",
    "Your first stop should be the TAVERN,\nwhere you can hire additional party\nmembers to help your team!",
    "This is the academy, where your party\nmembers can equip their class-specific\npowers prior to battle.",
    "Every 5 levels, a character gains access\nto a new power!  Don't forget to choose\na new one every 5 levels!",
    "This is the Armory, where you can equip\nyour party members.  To select a party\nmember, tap their portrait at the top\nof the screen.",
    "Their equipment is shown on the left,\nand your inventory is shown on the right.",
    "To change their equipment, simply drag\nthe item's icon where you want it!",
    "Lastly, you can upgrade some items if\nyou have enough gold.  This is usually\nvery expensive though!  Just tap an item\nto see if it can be upgraded.",
    "This is the merchant menu, where you\ncan buy new items, or sell things you\ndon't need.",
    "Tapping an item will display information\nabout it, and light up the portraits of\nthe party members who can use it.",
    "The merchant's wares are random,\nand will update after each battle, so\ncheck back often for new stuff!",
    "This is the keep, where extra party\nmembers wait in reserve.  You can field\nonly 4 heroes at a time.",
    "To add or remove units from your\nlineup, simply tap their portrait to swap\nthem in or out of the main group.",
    "It looks like someone in your party has\nreached level 5.  You should visit the\nACADEMY to learn a new power!",
    "This is an arena.  Here you can put your party\nto the ultimate test!",
    "In the arena, monsters become more and\nmore powerful the more you defeat, until\nyou're inevitably overwhelmed.",
    "The longer you can survive, the greater\nthe reward!  Some of the most powerful\nitems in the game can be found here.\nGive it a try!"
   ],
