   "dialogStrings": [
    "Greetings!  My name is Lucille, and I've\nbeen sent to greet you by the King!",
    "As you surely know, our land is besieged\nby a plague of terrible monsters!",
    "M'lord seeks a commander who would\nlead an army of noble adventurers to\ncleanse these lands of evil.",
    "I believe you are the champion he seeks!",
    "... however you have only just arrived,\nand surely need practice commanding\ntroops in battle.",
    "Follow me to the training grounds,\nand we shall begin!"
